<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower than Wednesday's close. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    54.50-56.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    40.00-43.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    47.00-51.00</p>
</text>
